::: cards 3
### [The Harbour Gazette](demo/gazette)
A real newspaper: white paper, serif type, three columns, drop cap, pull quote and classifieds.
{small:@bg · @font serif · ::: 3 · @dropcap}
+++
### [Hals Havn BBS](demo/bbs)
An old dial-up board: 80×25 text screen, ANSI colours, frames and hot keys.
{small:@grid 80x25 · hex colours · [M] keys}
+++
### [Pattern book](demo/patterns)
Every building block with the text that makes it, ready to copy.
{small:cards · #links · copy buttons}
+++
### [Hals Havn · now](demo/now)
A live dashboard: ticker, glowing numbers, sparklines, ring and compass.
{small:@ticker · {glow} · {spark} · {ring}}
+++
### [Harbour Zine](demo/zine)
A photocopied magazine: huge slanted type, stamps, tape and torn slips.
{small:{tilt} · {stamp} · shadows · slips}
+++
### [Crew of Mågen 🔒](demo/crew)
A locked page: only the crew can open it. Try it from another node.
{small:@allow group · @locked}
:::

>!blue [shadow] **Write on the boards.** Every design has a notice board at the bottom. Notes are kept by this node, at most 100 characters, one a minute.

